\import{base-macros}

\p{\strong{Status:} draft. The measurements are being taken; the table and the choice follow.}

\p{\strong{Context.} The release is [one executable](design-packaging) whose plain run must be the fastest configuration. What one invocation of an executable is, is a single run of a fresh process, with the load pipelined and the automatic worker count; the settings are therefore chosen on cold single runs of the native image over the eight corpora, inside quiet-core windows, and not on the warm passes of [the metric](dec-7QMU).}
